1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:02,733
Your inbox receives instructions.

2
00:00:02,867 --> 00:00:04,700
Should an AI trust them?

3
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:07,700
An email can try to override the assistant.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,700
Skill Y T flags suspicious language and routes the message to review.

5
00:00:12,267 --> 00:00:14,933
Skill Y T reads a synthetic inbox, classifies

6
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:17,067
messages, and applies rules in code.

7
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:19,733
Eligible inquiries become acknowledgment drafts.

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,700
Other messages wait for review.

9
00:00:22,267 --> 00:00:24,333
The agent can prepare a reply.

10
00:00:24,433 --> 00:00:26,633
A person decides what to do with it.

11
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:29,733
There is no send operation in the agent interface.

12
00:00:30,267 --> 00:00:32,033
The offline run created one draft.

13
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,167
Local checks passed forty-five Python tests and twelve Node tests.

14
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:37,700
The dedicated Docker job passed in GitHub Actions.

15
00:00:38,267 --> 00:00:40,700
Secure Inbox AI Agent.

16
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:44,567
Explore the source and reproduce the demo on GitHub.
